-- The demo template store's front page (the theme showcase plan's quick fixes): the page left from a test, a photo with dark words
-- over it and a row of typing ("hgkjjhgkjh", "Reusable"), was what every theme's public preview drew and what each new store was copied
-- with. It becomes a plain demo home: a hero with light words over the darkened photo, the products, and a line about the store. Only
-- the template's front page, and only while it still holds that test text, so a page changed by hand since is left alone. Data only.
